<section class="ref-group"><h2>Treaties <span class="n">2</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/peace-of-naupactus"><span class="enc-name">Peace of Naupactus</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 217 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The Peace of Naupactus, concluded in 217 BCE, ended the Social War between the Hellenic alliance led by Philip V of Macedon and the Aetolian League.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/peace-of-phoenice"><span class="enc-name">Peace of Phoenice</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · Peace · 205 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The Peace of Phoenice was the treaty that ended the First Macedonian War between Rome and Philip V of Macedon in 205 BCE.</span></a></li></ul></section>
